# --- Read through indirect accessors (_env_value, _flag, subflag_enabled, ...) ---
# These were invisible to a plain os.getenv() grep, which is why they were missed
# for so long. The livestream audio trace switches below are the observability
# for the exact failure mode this recovery was opened for: leaving them off means
# the next 'engine did not remain active' report arrives with no evidence.

